# §11.4.30 / CONST-053 repository hygiene.
#
# Model weights (FLUX.1-dev transformer + Nunchaku NVFP4 + T5-XXL, tens of GB)
# are NEVER versioned — they are third-party HuggingFace artefacts pulled on
# demand. §11.4.77 regeneration mechanism: .gitignore-meta/flux_nunchaku_nvfp4.yaml
# (download from the cited HF repos) + the harness setup step.
models/
*.safetensors
*.gguf
*.ckpt
*.pt
*.pth

# Python caches / build artefacts.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
